   "t": 1791260956.885529,
   "kind": "assistant_text",
   "text": "The stop rule fired and the search has ended. The harness is reporting best=1.6270, confirming my single-feature specification (feature 13, long) achieved an in-sample annualized Sharpe of 1.627, net of costs, comfortably clearing my 1.2 bar after just one move.\n\nGiven this is a single, strong, parsimonious feature (not an overfit combination of 3), I have reasonable confidence it will generalize, though I'll expect meaningful shrinkage out-of-sample as is typical \u2014 in-sample Sharpes from feature selection tend to overstate true OOS performance, even with light search (1 move, no swapping/overfitting multiple candidates here)."
  },
  {
